    "answer": {
      "short": "$16\\text{ cm}$",
      "worked": "Since $l=r\\theta$,\n$$\\begin{align*}\nA&=\\frac12r^2\\theta\\\\\nA&=\\frac12r(r\\theta)\\\\\nA&=\\frac12rl\\\\\n32\\pi&=\\frac12r(4\\pi)\\\\\nr&=16\\text{ cm}.\n\\end{align*}$$",
